前必需目标：4 项（按原顺序完整保留）\n\n1. \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 a526d2d9-593f-4d9d-922e-2212f3337756 / v2：对应本次当前结果\n\n2. \"LOCAL_CASE_RESOURCE_ASSOCIATION\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 800f6858-188e-4174-a461-9d9d28d0d000 / v3：对应本次当前结果\n\n3. \"LOCAL_INTERNAL_ACCEPTANCE\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 0f5c2f17-d006-4479-a140-53e4b017a9f7 / v4：对应本次当前结果\n\n4. \"LOCAL_SYNTHETIC_RECEIPT_ACKNOWLEDGEMENT\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 3a994008-708b-4d29-9607-484a74dd68e8 / v5：对应本次当前结果\n\n资格：NOT_EVALUATED；外部受理：NOT_SUBMITTED；线下履约：NO_EVIDENCE；Case目标未完成。\n原采用来源和旧计划只作为历史引用；当前所有目标均在上方保留。\n原行/原来源指纹引用原接口完整投影；导出的白名单子对象不用于重算这些原指纹。下方整包核对数据指纹可按JSON规范化重算。\n核对数据 SHA256：5988313727a8bc4b6c4bb6653e26ef729b08b8605035b94d8616ff4e43c72f80\n核对数据（UTF-8 JSON，原文按JSON转义；不包含读取凭据）：\n{\n  \"actor_id\": \"fixture-a\",\n  \"preparation_id\": \"41bb04de-bb52-43a7-92df-d694ba001735\",\n  \"case_id\": \"82fb9853-16de-405d-8379-afe4dc5e4cae\",\n  \"run_id\": \"73ff1207-73be-4fec-9bd6-004a480ccf9e\",\n  \"preparation_revision\": 8,\n  \"request_revision\": 6,\n  \"current_request\": \"SYNTHETIC current ordinary outputs\",\n  \"original_request\": \"PRIVATE_REQUEST_A\",\n  \"plan_id\": \"15a8a91f-da97-4a2c-bbcb-78ab23249914\",\n  \"plan_revision\": 5,\n  \"state\": \"LOCAL_OUTPUTS_VERIFIED\",\n  \"read_only\": true,\n  \"automatically_verified\": false,\n  \"case_goal_completed\": false,\n  \"qualification\": \"NOT_EVALUATED\",\n  \"external_acceptance\": \"NOT_SUBMITTED\",\n  \"offline_fulfillment\": \"NO_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_CASE_RECORD_PACK_V1\",\n  \"source_scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_ADOPTED_LOCAL_GOAL_RESULTS_ONLY\",\n  \"current_required_goals\": [\n    \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_CASE_RESOURCE_ASSOCIATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_INTERNAL_ACCEPTANCE